        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since Atlassian was founded in Sydney, Australia in 2002, we’ve advanced our progress towards our mission with a deep investment in product development to build innovative, high-value, and versatile apps that users love.",
