        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer team collaboration products on our Data Center deployment option, such as Jira, Confluence, Jira Service Management, Bitbucket, Crowd, and Bamboo.",
        "start_character": 15350,
        "end_character": 15505
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001650372-25-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001650372-25-000036-ccfc42e98f66db73",
        "accession_number": "0001650372-25-000036",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With more than 300,000 customers using our software today, we are able to reach millions of users, gather insights to continually improve our offerings, and generate revenue growth by expanding within our customer accounts.",
        "start_character": 19868,
        "end_character": 20091
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001650372-25-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001650372-25-000036-ccfc42e98f66db73",
        "accession_number": "0001650372-25-000036",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to the protection provided by our registered intellectual property rights, we protect our intellectual property rights by imposing contractual obligations on third parties who develop or access our technology.",
        "start_character": 26567,
        "end_character": 26788
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001650372-25-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001650372-25-000036-ccfc42e98f66db73",
        "accession_number": "0001650372-25-000036",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our employees, consultants and contractors are also subject to invention assignment agreements, pursuant to which we obtain rights to technology that they develop for us.",
        "start_character": 26899,
        "end_character": 27069
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001650372-25-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001650372-25-000036-ccfc42e98f66db73",
        "accession_number": "0001650372-25-000036",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These benefits vary by country and are designed to meet or exceed local laws and to be competitive in the regions in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 33712,
        "end_character": 33846
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001650372-25-000036",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001650372-25-000036-ccfc42e98f66db73",
        "accession_number": "0001650372-25-000036",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also invest in people development and sustainability programs, in addition to our total rewards program, which includes competitive compensation and benefits and a distributed work approach.",
